  displayName: Sniper
  role: 3
  description: 'A lone marksman who picks off key enemies from up to 50 m. At 150%
    accuracy every shot hits, with a 50% chance to crit, and you choose exactly which
    enemy soldier to shoot: ideal for removing sergeants and officers. The Sniper
    Rifle can''t fire after moving, and with 5 health and no armor the Sniper must
    stay out of sight; moving 15 m, they can reposition quickly between shots. A
    Specialist and a Solo unit: one per army.'
